Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:31:35 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,440 --> 00:00:02,480] | Words: 13 | Text: 絕大多數普通人一輩子翻不了身
Segment #2   [00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:05,540] | Words: 15 | Text: 藏著一個最致命、最難察覺的思維陷阱
Segment #3   [00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:07,000] | Words: 7  | Text: 習慣性向外歸音
Segment #4   [00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,580] | Words: 11 | Text: 越喜歡抱怨的人越難突破現狀
Segment #5   [00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,360] | Words: 9  | Text: 這是弱者逃不開的宿命
Segment #6   [00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,920] | Words: 14 | Text: 更是普通人難以自御的思維決正
Segment #7   [00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:17,160] | Words: 14 | Text: 今天我把歸音邏輯從根源給你拆明白
Segment #8   [00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,640] | Words: 6  | Text: 什麼是向外歸音
Segment #9   [00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,940] | Words: 6  | Text: 但凡日子不順
Segment #10  [00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,980] | Words: 4  | Text: 選擇出錯
Segment #11  [00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:21,980] | Words: 5  | Text: 事實不如意
Segment #12  [00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,740] | Words: 10 | Text: 永遠習慣向外尋找藉口
Segment #13  [00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,480] | Words: 8  | Text: 轉不到錢怪大環境差
Segment #14  [00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:27,620] | Words: 10 | Text: 工作憋取怪老闆不通人情
Segment #15  [00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,780] | Words: 10 | Text: 關係破裂怪別人難以相處
Segment #16  [00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:30,640] | Words: 4  | Text: 旅旅失異
Segment #17  [00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,880] | Words: 5  | Text: 怪自己運氣不好
Segment #18  [00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:34,180] | Words: 11 | Text: 這套思維看似能安復情緒
Segment #19  [00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:35,340] | Words: 4  | Text: 保全自尊
Segment #20  [00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:37,720] | Words: 14 | Text: 實則親手關上了你所有翻盤的大門
Segment #21  [00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,520] | Words: 8  | Text: 記住這條殘酷真相
Segment #22  [00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:41,260] | Words: 10 | Text: 只要你把問題歸結於外部
Segment #23  [00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:43,020] | Words: 8  | Text: 你就永遠沒有辦法改變結果
Segment #24  [00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:43,880] | Words: 2  | Text: 實局
Segment #25  [00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,560] | Words: 2  | Text: 他人
Segment #26  [00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,040] | Words: 2  | Text: 機遇
Segment #27  [00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:45,660] | Words: 2  | Text: 環境
Segment #28  [00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,380] | Words: 9  | Text: 全都不在你的掌控之內
Segment #29  [00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,620] | Words: 13 | Text: 當你把失敗推給不可控的外界
Segment #30  [00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,680] | Words: 6  | Text: 潛意是已經認輸
Segment #31  [00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,520] | Words: 5  | Text: 我無能為力
Segment #32  [00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:52,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 只能任命
Segment #33  [00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:53,860] | Words: 8  | Text: 這就是抱怨的死循環
Segment #34  [00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,040] | Words: 6  | Text: 越抱怨越無力
Segment #35  [00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,580] | Words: 3  | Text: 越無力
Segment #36  [00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:56,160] | Words: 3  | Text: 越抱怨
Segment #37  [00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:57,800] | Words: 7  | Text: 最後徹底妥協唐平
Segment #38  [00:00:58,220 --> 00:00:59,380] | Words: 7  | Text: 習慣向外歸因的人
Segment #39  [00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:01,500] | Words: 12 | Text: 終究只能被動接受命運安排
Segment #40  [00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,140] | Words: 7  | Text: 而強者能夠逆襲
Segment #41  [00:01:03,140 --> 00:01:05,080] | Words: 9  | Text: 核心利耀就是向內歸因
Segment #42  [00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:07,220] | Words: 9  | Text: 很多人一直去解向內歸因
Segment #43  [00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,640] | Words: 7  | Text: 以為凡事反思自己
Segment #44  [00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,840] | Words: 5  | Text: 就是自我否定
Segment #45  [00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:10,760] | Words: 4  | Text: 自我打壓
Segment #46  [00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:11,960] | Words: 5  | Text: 以為責怪自己
Segment #47  [00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,980] | Words: 7  | Text: 這個理解大錯特錯
Segment #48  [00:01:13,980 --> 00:01:15,060] | Words: 7  | Text: 真正的向內歸因
Segment #49  [00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,060] | Words: 5  | Text: 本質只有一句
Segment #50  [00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 外界無法左右
Segment #51  [00:01:17,240 --> 00:01:18,160] | Words: 4  | Text: 但我身上
Segment #52  [00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,620] | Words: 7  | Text: 永遠存在可以調整
Segment #53  [00:01:19,620 --> 00:01:20,200] | Words: 2  | Text: 優化
Segment #54  [00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 提升的地方
Segment #55  [00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,260] | Words: 4  | Text: 行情低迷
Segment #56  [00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,480] | Words: 6  | Text: 依舊有人賺到結果
Segment #57  [00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,280] | Words: 7  | Text: 差距在於我的認知
Segment #58  [00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,300] | Words: 5  | Text: 和變現能力
Segment #59  [00:01:26,300 --> 00:01:27,220] | Words: 4  | Text: 相處矛盾
Segment #60  [00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:28,680] | Words: 7  | Text: 有人能夠和目共處
Segment #61  [00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,960] | Words: 12 | Text: 差距在於我的溝通方式與格局
Segment #62  [00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,080] | Words: 4  | Text: 做事實力
Segment #63  [00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:33,440] | Words: 7  | Text: 有人持續拿到成果
Segment #64  [00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,140] | Words: 7  | Text: 差距在於我的預判
Segment #65  [00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:36,520] | Words: 6  | Text: 方案和執行力
Segment #66  [00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,580] | Words: 4  | Text: 向內歸因
Segment #67  [00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:38,540] | Words: 5  | Text: 不是盲目覽則
Segment #68  [00:01:38,540 --> 00:01:39,460] | Words: 5  | Text: 不是持續自責
Segment #69  [00:01:39,460 --> 00:01:41,400] | Words: 10 | Text: 而是奪回人生全部主動權
Segment #70  [00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,780] | Words: 6  | Text: 外界你掌控不了
Segment #71  [00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:43,720] | Words: 4  | Text: 但你的認知
Segment #72  [00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:44,940] | Words: 4  | Text: 選擇行動
Segment #73  [00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:45,500] | Words: 2  | Text: 復盤
Segment #74  [00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:46,100] | Words: 2  | Text: 習慣
Segment #75  [00:01:46,100 --> 00:01:47,560] | Words: 6  | Text: 完全有自己說了算
Segment #76  [00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:49,160] | Words: 9  | Text: 只要還有可以調整的空間
Segment #77  [00:01:49,160 --> 00:01:51,100] | Words: 9  | Text: 你就永遠擁有翻盤的機會
Segment #78  [00:01:51,100 --> 00:01:52,340] | Words: 5  | Text: 持續打摩自己
Segment #79  [00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:54,280] | Words: 8  | Text: 前路就永遠不會毒死
Segment #80  [00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,380] | Words: 4  | Text: 兩種思維
Segment #81  [00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:57,200] | Words: 9  | Text: 造就兩種截然不同的人生
Segment #82  [00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,440] | Words: 5  | Text: 向外歸因的人
Segment #83  [00:01:58,440 --> 00:02:00,000] | Words: 8  | Text: 被動等待環境變好
Segment #84  [00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,280] | Words: 6  | Text: 一生隨波主流
Segment #85  [00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,420] | Words: 5  | Text: 向內歸因的人
Segment #86  [00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:03,540] | Words: 8  | Text: 主動持續自我跌帶
Segment #87  [00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,620] | Words: 6  | Text: 掌握人生走向
Segment #88  [00:02:04,620 --> 00:02:06,220] | Words: 8  | Text: 成年人最重要的覺醒
Segment #89  [00:02:06,220 --> 00:02:07,220] | Words: 5  | Text: 就是放下抱怨
Segment #90  [00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:08,320] | Words: 5  | Text: 丟掉所有藉口
Segment #91  [00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,440] | Words: 6  | Text: 停止向外歸因
Segment #92  [00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,560] | Words: 6  | Text: 不再刻則環境
Segment #93  [00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,860] | Words: 6  | Text: 不再指責旁人
Segment #94  [00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,140] | Words: 8  | Text: 不再糾結運氣好壞
Segment #95  [00:02:13,140 --> 00:02:14,220] | Words: 5  | Text: 多審視自身
Segment #96  [00:02:14,220 --> 00:02:15,080] | Words: 4  | Text: 短板在哪
Segment #97  [00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,060] | Words: 4  | Text: 哪裡可以改進
Segment #98  [00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:17,340] | Words: 5  | Text: 如何持續驚進
Segment #99  [00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:19,540] | Words: 11 | Text: 當你的思維切換成向內歸因
Segment #100 [00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:20,220] | Words: 2  | Text: 內耗
Segment #101 [00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:20,800] | Words: 2  | Text: 抱怨
Segment #102 [00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,640] | Words: 9  | Text: 自我設限會立刻消失
Segment #103 [00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,640] | Words: 4  | Text: 成長速度
Segment #104 [00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,620] | Words: 10 | Text: 翻身的進度會成倍提升
Segment #105 [00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:26,720] | Words: 4  | Text: 向外歸因
Segment #106 [00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,260] | Words: 8  | Text: 是普通人被動任命
Segment #107 [00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,120] | Words: 4  | Text: 向內歸因
Segment #108 [00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,720] | Words: 8  | Text: 是成年人主動改名
